！？灵鸠微瞪着眼睛，看见外头卿翰林俯身下来，在她耳边冷酷的训导，“到了宋家后要乖乖听话，坏了卿家的名声，难过只有你自己！别怪爹心狠，要怪就怪你有个祸害的娘，自己又是个文不成武不就，毫无作用的废物。从今往后，在宋家是死是活，全看你自己了。”灵鸠沉默了一会，像是在品味卿翰林的话，舔了下干燥嘴唇，没有起伏的说：“我觉得，最该怪的是你色欲熏心禁不住诱惑，如果你没上了人家祸水姑娘，哪来我这个废物。”卿翰林恼羞成怒，大掌朝灵鸠挥去，“孽障！”左脸火辣辣的疼，嘴里也尝到了血味，灵鸠眼泪汪汪的认真道：“抛妻弃子，卖女求荣，一言不合动手打人，你会招天谴的！”“盖上！送走！”卿翰林挥袖，像甩掉什么肮脏的垃圾。礼箱盖子被狠狠拍下，遮蔽灵鸠所有的视线，一瞬的起伏后，平稳的前进。她知道，她要被当做礼物被卖出去了。黑暗中，灵鸠擦拭着眼中的生理泪水，思考着自己的现状。她穿越了，穿越成了一个不知名的世界中，成为只有七岁同名灵鸠的小萝莉，这个小萝莉被妹妹卿灵鹊推倒地上，撞到脑门一命呜呼，然后被她占据了身子。她穿越了，说明她原来的身体也死了？也就是说前世她一脑门撞到了电脑屏幕上不是幻觉了。灵鸠心想，难道叫灵鸠的人都活该被抛弃吗。前世的她出生普通家庭，不普通的是她天生开了天眼，能看到天地鬼怪。小时她看到‘那些’不但不怕，反而觉得骄傲，认为这是自己的才能，所以喜欢在父母面前表现。一开始分辨不开真人和鬼怪，她会不由的打招呼，然后惹来周围人诡异的目光，父母打着她的屁股向周围的人僵硬的笑着道歉，说孩子好玩调皮。一次宴会，她对父母着急的说，姑婆被鬼缠住了，迎接而来的是爸爸的一耳光。一个月后，姑婆死了，一切从那里开始变化。父母看着她厌弃恐惧的眼神，亲戚朋友的远离厌恶，初中后就被安排住校，一直到高一那年，父母有了弟弟后，搬家也不和她说一声，让她着急的报警，放下学业，寻鬼问路，花了半年的时间才找到他们。她永远记得那一刻她的高兴如狂，跑到抱着弟弟在院子里散步的妈妈面前，然而对方看到她时，却是厌恶惊恐，大声尖叫：你来干什么！？你又想来祸害自己的亲弟弟了吗！我们有哪里对不起你，让你这么死抓着不放！爸爸从房里跑出来，手里拿着扳手，看着她的眼神有愧疚，更多的还是厌弃和惊恐，对她说：你走吧，我们老了也不用你养，看在我们白养你这么多年的份上，不要再来找我们了。她不记得自己是怎么离开，眼泪糊了满脸，心里发誓要做个正常人。几年她行走寺庙，跟人盗墓，淘古玩市场，找遍了办法也没有让眼睛恢复正常，反而学到了一些古老的符咒护身术，最终做起了资深宅女。每日看看小说，打打游戏，做做淘宝客服，在密网里接接画符的单子，享年二十四死在电脑桌前。也许，死在电脑桌前，是所有宅系生物最好的归宿？灵鸠默默的自我吐槽一句。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－新文开了，又萌又软又治愈的新文献上，请各位放心享用~激情当然也不能少！么么哒╭（╯3╰）╮", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/qingbenheimengzhiyaofeilaixi/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 001 At the beginning, I always walk through the lotus pond where light rain falls, with ripples on the green leaves, and the vast mist is like a map of mountains and rivers. In the mist and emotion, I only hear the sweet sound of dripping. Lingjiu stood in the Liantang Bridge Pavilion, looking at the girl in front of her. The girl is less than ten years old, with red lips and white teeth, willow eyebrows and starry eyes, black hair combed into double temples, and wearing a goose-yellow Confucian skirt. \"Broom star, I told you a long time ago, you are not allowed to pester my brother Mei. Hum, this is your fate!\" A tender white finger pointed at her nose, only three inches away from touching her nose. Lingjiu didn't squint his eyes, silently reciting the incantation with an expressionless face, and pinched the hand with his fingers. Hey, why hasn’t the antique illusion around me changed? \"Hey! Broomstick! Are you deaf? This lady is talking to you! I tell you, you can't escape. Daddy has already agreed to give you to that sick man from the Song family as a child bride!\" It's so noisy. Lingjiu sighed in his heart and strode forward. She remembered that she had just stayed up late to read a novel about Qidian cheating her mother. To vent her anger, she left a sentence: \"The author's stepfather did not give up on treatment, and the protagonist was stupid and refused to explain.\" I wish the author that in the future you will never buy instant noodles without pancakes, have pancakes but no ingredients, have ingredients but no noodles, goodbye forever. ’ After commenting, he felt dizzy as soon as he stood up, and his head was hit... Lingjiu touched his forehead, and the stinging pain was extremely real. After it was dark, he opened his eyes again, and what he saw was the girl in ancient costume in front of him, and the antique and quiet surroundings. How could there be a girl dressed like this in modern times? She must be a ghost. Lingjiu chose to ignore it as always, so that the ghosts wouldn't know the difference between her and normal people. It just backfired. \"Broom star, how dare you ignore me!\" The girl in yellow glared angrily, reached out and grabbed Lingjiu's hair, and pulled it back fiercely. \"Hiss.\" Lingjiu took a breath of pain and looked at the girl in surprise. Why she could touch herself. Soon, Lingjiu ignored the problem because it hurt too much to have his hair pulled. \"Let go.\" He said, but Lingjiu was startled again. What's going on with this soft, cool childish voice! ? \"Don't let me go, don't let me go! You ugly idiot, I want you to ignore me. I want you to know how powerful I am!\" The girl became more and more enthusiastic. Lingjiu became angry and threw the girl away with a shoulder throw. \"Xiao Que, what's going on? Get up and let dad take a look!\" A man's concerned voice came out of the blue. Lingjiu looked up and saw a group of people walking towards him on the bluestone road in the forest garden not far away. Seeing the middle-aged man holding the girl in yellow, Lingjiu didn't know why the information of \"Dad\" and \"Qing Hanlin\" suddenly appeared in Lingjiu's mind, and then a line of sight fell on her. Following that line of sight, he saw a handsome boy of thirteen or fourteen years old, with snowy skin and red lips, and rich clothes, like a orchid orchid tree. The information about 'Jiang Wumei' and 'Brother Mei' flooded into his mind crazily, and the pain in his brain made Lingjiu's face turn pale. \"Dad, daddy, Jiu'er hit me!\" The girl in yellow hugged the middle-aged man's neck, buried her head on his chest, and cried aggrievedly, \"I advise Jiu'er not to be sad. Daddy is doing it for Jiu'er's good and has found a good person for Jiu'er. Home, but Jiu'er didn't listen to me and hit me, wuwu!\" Qing Hanlin patted his daughter's back lovingly, and after a while of comfort, he raised his head and glanced at Lingjiu. The look of disgust in his eyes made Lingjiu's heart hurt. In her memory, her parents also looked at her with such eyes. \"Nephew Jiang, I'm telling you a joke.\" When Qing Hanlin looked at the graceful young man beside him, his expression had returned to gentleness. \"No.\" Jiang Wumei looked at the expressionless girl standing on the bridge, surprised that her eyes were not as eager and obsessed as before. This bit of surprise could not touch his cold and arrogant heart, and he had no intention of protecting her, \"Uncle Qing, I think it's getting late, and you still have to deal with housework, so my nephew will leave first.\" \"Brother Mei, no, you said you wanted to tell Xiao Que a story last time!\" Qing Ling Que poked her head out of Qing Hanlin's arms. \"Tell Xiaoque when you come next time.\" Jiang Wumei's attitude was neither far nor close. He bowed to Qing Hanlin and turned to leave. He left without any regrets. It wasn't until many years later that I regretted it so much that I hated myself for not protecting that girl standing alone. Even though her predicament could be solved with just one sentence, I didn't even bother to speak. \"Come here, tie up the young lady and send her to the Song family!\" Qing Hanlin turned his face faster than he could flip through a book. Four strong men walked towards Lingjiu. Lingjiu, who knew the current affairs, remained motionless for Junjie and allowed them to tie him up completely. After being carried along for about ten minutes, she saw the ancient scenery and the chaotic memories that filled her mind, which made Lingjiu suddenly realize that she had traveled through time! Being stuffed into... a gift box! ? Lingjiu opened her eyes slightly and saw Qing Hanlin leaning down outside and giving cold instructions in her ear, \"When you get to the Song family, you must be obedient. If you ruin the reputation of the Qing family, you are the only one who will be sad! Don't blame dad for being cruel. If not, blame you for the trouble.\" Mom, you are a useless waste who is incompetent in both literature and martial arts. From now on, whether you live or die in the Song family is entirely up to you.\" Lingjiu was silent for a while, as if savoring Qing Hanlin's words, he licked his dry lips without any hesitation. He said: \"I think the most blameworthy thing is that you are so lustful that you can't resist temptation. If you didn't fall in love with the troublesome girl, how could I be a loser?\" Qing Hanlin became angry and swung his big palm towards Lingjiu, \"Evil!\" The left side of his face was burning with pain. , and tasted blood in his mouth, Lingjiu said seriously with tears in his eyes: \"Abandon your wife and son, sell your daughter for glory, hit someone if you disagree, you will be punished by God!\" \"Cover it! Send it away!\" Qing Hanlin waved his sleeves, as if throwing away some dirty garbage. The lid of the gift box was severely photographed, blocking all Lingjiu's sight. After a moment of ups and downs, he moved forward steadily. She knew she was being sold as a gift. in the dark,", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}